cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "IndicRecipeNutri"
abstract: >-
  A corpus of 220,187 Indian recipes with multilingual provenance and estimated
  dish-level micronutrition, a typed knowledge graph of 223,406 nodes
  and 6.27M edges, a 68-query retrieval benchmark, and a synthetic collaborative
  interaction log. Structured and derived fields only; recipe prose is not
  redistributed and is recoverable via the published rehydration index.
authors:
